  {t="G", text="Orgrimmar's Valley of Strength", z=1637, x=55.6, y=72.3, tip="Head to Orgrimmar's main gate, just west of Skull Rock (Warriors: north along the road from Far Watch Post). The next guide starts in Orgrimmar: Neeru Fireblade takes the cultists' quest, the trainers teach your new ranks, and the zeppelin leaves from the towers outside the gate for Tirisfal Glades and Silverpine Forest. The Barrens come after Silverpine.", races={"orc"}, section="Durotar (1-12)", zoneName="Orgrimmar", p=215, place="To Orgrimmar"}, -- 664
