  {t="C", q=6393, name="Elemental War", gv="Collect", gw="Incendrites", z=406, x=37.34, y=60.45, note="Collect Incendrites", tip="South-west of Sun Rock lies the burned Charred Vale. Plant the Gaea Seeds in the dirt mounds on the valley floor; the fire elementals drop Incendrites. Bloodfury Harpies and Ambushers nest on the north side, Slayers and Roguefeathers to the south. Careful: the Burning Destroyers, Scorched Basilisks and Bloodfury Storm Witches here are level 27 and the valley floor is crowded: pull one at a time and keep to its edges.", section="The Barrens & Stonetalon Mountains (24-27)", zoneName="Stonetalon Mountains", p=819, place="The Charred Vale: kill these as you meet them", was=2278}, -- 2340
