  {t="N", text="Je'neu offers a Blackfathom Deeps quest next; leave it unless you have a group.", tip="Back west to Zoram'gar from Thistlefur before heading east for good.", section="Ashenvale & Thousand Needles (27-29)", p=833, place="Zoram'gar Outpost"}, -- 2372
