  {t="N", text="Test of Endurance (Grenka Bloodscreech, 31) waits for the next Freewind visit, at about 30: keep it.", section="Ashenvale & Thousand Needles (27-29)", p=888, place="Dorn Plainstalker"}, -- 2481
