  {t="N", text="Collect Dull Iron Key", note="Dull Iron Key, from Jailor Eston", tip="South-east of Tarren Mill. Drull and Tog'thar are chained in the keep's courtyard buildings, and each lock needs its key: Jailor Eston carries the Dull Iron Key for Drull's, Jailor Marlgen the Burnished Gold Key for Tog'thar's, both in the keep. Kill them first, then open both locks.", notTurnedIn={498}, section="Hillsbrad Foothills (29-31)", p=934, place="Durnholde Keep"}, -- 2575
