  {t="N", text="Collect Cortello's Riddle", group=true, tip="The scroll, Cortello's Riddle, lies on the decks of the three ships off the Wild Shore, crewed by pirates of 42-45 who come in pairs, with captains of 45-48: take it with a group. Its chain runs on through the Swamp of Sorrows, Dustwallow Marsh and the Hinterlands.", section="Stranglethorn Vale & Swamp of Sorrows (39-42)", p=1212, place="The Bloodsail ships"}, -- 3282
