  {t="N", text="Collect Gorilla Fang", group=true, note="Gorilla Fang", tip="Careful: three waves of gorillas come one after another with little rest between, then Mokk the Savage. Start at full health and mana, and stay near Unbagwa. Some classes find it hard alone: a friend makes it easy.", onQuest={348}, section="Feralas & Tanaris (44-47)", p=1358, place="Witch Doctor Unbagwa"}, -- 3606
