  {t="G", text="Grom'gol flight master", z=8, x=32.5, y=29.3, tip="Stranglethorn's errands are done: from Grom'gol's flight master, fly on to Stonard for the swamp's coast and Misty Reed Post, which fit you now.", taxi="Stonard", section="Feralas & Tanaris (44-47)", zoneName="Swamp of Sorrows", p=1382, place="Fly to Stonard"}, -- 3659
