  {t="TR", text="Train with Kildar", optional=true, z=1637, x=69.41, y=13.1, note="Kildar, riding trainer", tip="Riding needs level 40 and costs 100 gold; learning it gives you a mount. Kildar teaches Orcs in the Valley of Honor, by Ogunaro Wolfrunner's kennel. Skyborne learn it from Genn Fairweather at the Fairweather Stables in Valanaar on Zephras Isle, with a Galestrider: the skyboat to the isle leaves the cliffs south of Skywatcher Plateau, north of Thunder Bluff, about every five minutes. Your race's other mounts are 20 gold each: Collectibles, Mounts · Level 40 has a guide for each.", races={"orc"}, classes={"!Warlock"}, lvlMin=40.0, noSkill="Riding", section="Feralas & Tanaris (44-47)", zoneName="Orgrimmar", p=1403, place="Riding at 40"}, -- 3708
