  {t="F", text="Brackenwall Village", tip="No Muisek vessel to bring Uzer'i (you didn't take the Feralas & Tanaris guide's chain): fly from here straight to Brackenwall Village.", notInZone="Feralas", section="Dustwallow Marsh (47-47)", p=1484, place="Fly to Brackenwall Village"}, -- 3940
