  {t="N", text="From here on pick up every Power Crystal (blue, green, red, yellow) and every Un'Goro Soil pile you pass: 20 for Hamuul, and 5 more for Pestlezugg if you carry Bungle in the Jungle.", section="Un'Goro Crater, Burning Steppes & Western Plaguelands (51-53)", p=1641, place="Out of the refuge"}, -- 4351
