  {t="N", text="The Videre Elixir comes from Gregan Brewspewer in Feralas, later in this guide. Donova's next errand, Strange Sources, is at the mouth of Darkwhisper Gorge among level 59-60 elites: it waits for the last guide's Winterspring loop.", section="Winterspring, Felwood & Thunder Bluff (53-54)", p=1770, place="Donova Snowden"}, -- 4657
  {t="G", text="Everlook", z=618, x=60.7, y=38.2, tip="Ride east along the road past Lake Kel'Theril to Everlook first: its yeti and chimaera errands bring you about a quarter of a level, which the Frostfire furbolg camps want; Donova's camps come on the ride back west.", section="Winterspring, Felwood & Thunder Bluff (53-54)", zoneName="Winterspring", p=1771, place="Winterspring"}, -- 4658
  {t="FP", text="Everlook flight path", tip="Everlook is the goblin town on the east side of the valley, past the owlbeast hills.", section="Winterspring, Felwood & Thunder Bluff (53-54)", p=1772, place="Everlook"}, -- 4659
  {t="N", text="Gregor's quests lead to other zones: keep them.", section="Winterspring, Felwood & Thunder Bluff (53-54)", p=1772, place="Everlook"}, -- 4660
