  {t="N", text="Umi's third prank targets goblins in Gadgetzan, Un'Goro and Everlook: keep it. Mount Hyjal is next: its way in starts here in Everlook; Gadgetzan, Linken's sword and Silithus follow it.", section="Western & Eastern Plaguelands, Felwood & Winterspring (55-56)", p=1918, place="Umi Rumplesnicker"}, -- 4983
  {t="F", text="Everlook", tip="Careful: elites stand along the whole way in. Frostmaul Giants and Preservers (59-60) flank the road through Frostwhisper Gorge, and Hederine Slayers, Initiates and Manastalkers (57-58) line Darkwhisper Gorge from its mouth to the zone line, with Lady Hederine (61) on its east side. Follow the arrows' line at full speed, never stop or fight on the way, and don't turn off it.", notInZone="Mount Hyjal", section="Mount Hyjal (56-58)", p=1919, place="Into Mount Hyjal"}, -- 4984
