  {t="FP", text="Tainted Foothills flight path", note="Bluebell", tip="South down the west side of the shrub field to the ancients' outpost: kill the Tainted Shrubbery you pass for Kaylaena. Bluebell, the flight mistress, waits by the outpost; Hyacinth and Thylaen stand with the ancient Fraxinus.", section="Mount Hyjal (56-58)", p=1926, place="The ancients' outpost"}, -- 5016
