  {t="FP", text="Summit of Eternity flight path", note="Fayran Elthas, at the flight point", tip="East up to the Summit of Eternity, the druids' camp. Fayran Elthas, the flight master, stands at its north end; Marn Euhorn, Toron Rockhoof and Thisalee Crow along the path south; Tiala Whitemane indoors next to Thisalee; Sebelia, the innkeeper, at the south-east end.", section="Mount Hyjal (56-58)", p=2031, place="The Summit of Eternity"}, -- 5266
